    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "<strong>We’re Open!:</strong> Featuring our curated cannabis experience, our collaborative artist gallery (coming soon), our Fresh Counter, and more, we’re hoping to become your go-to spot. (As long as you’re 21+, of course!)"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "<strong>Exhibit Program:</strong> (coming soon!) Calling all artists! We’re looking to showcase local artists of varying styles and modalities in our storefront including painting, photography, murals, ceramics, glasswork, apparel, music, and more. Interested in showcasing or performing at one of our events? Get in touch."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "<strong>Events &amp; Partnerships:</strong> Being a part of the community means lifting each other up. If you’d like to collaborate, let’s connect."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "html": "<strong>Education:</strong> CastleLeaf is a place where you can purchase high-quality cannabis goods and grow your curiosity. Check back here for future educational opportunities. We look forward to learning together."
    },
